Vendored fonts — SIL Open Font License 1.1
==========================================

Both font families bundled in this directory are licensed under the SIL Open
Font License, Version 1.1 (OFL-1.1). They are committed as static WOFF instances
solely so the server-side OG share-card renderer (Satori) has real font buffers.

  Bricolage Grotesque  (BricolageGrotesque-800.woff)
