    https://github.com/ateliertriay/bricolage

  Space Grotesk        (SpaceGrotesk-500.woff, SpaceGrotesk-700.woff)
    Copyright (c) The Space Grotesk Project Authors
    https://github.com/floriankarsten/space-grotesk

The full OFL-1.1 text is available at:
  https://openfontlicense.org/open-font-license-official-text/

Under OFL-1.1 these files may be bundled and redistributed with this software.
The Reserved Font Names ("Bricolage Grotesque", "Space Grotesk") must not be used
to promote modified versions; these files are unmodified upstream instances.
